  <item>
    <title>#06 中医针灸那些事儿 Side B</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692a60a20d5237d4de023d3b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692a60a20d5237d4de023d3b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Nov 2025 03:01:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听众朋友们好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次聊一聊中医（主要是针灸），另外为大家带一些我们对中西医的不同观点~</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制嘉宾：卤逊 （中医针灸医生）&amp; 飞飞 （中医妇科医生）&amp; 荦荦（超声科医生）</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：荦荦</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制时间：2025年6月29日</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制地点：感谢入场邀请主播Liz老师提供的场地和设备！</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6697c73037236c546ed7870e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6697c73037236c546ed7870e"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容仅代表嘉宾个人观点，如有任何不适，请及时寻求有医学专业资质机构及专业医生的帮助！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Side B Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> “卤教授”提到了精准医学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 医生要提供情绪价值吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 多维度看病，但是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> 工作量太大，真的很难。顺便提一嘴，播客发布的前天，门诊一个情绪激动的患者家属觉得我看得太快对我在言语上进行人身攻击，而我对待这种情况经验丰富（都是泪），于是忍气吞声满足了她的所有要求，终于平息了她的高声喧哗。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 患者在西医和中医医院的诉求不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 医生在医院也不能左右自己的工作环境或患者的就医环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 中药治疗肿瘤的原理究竟是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> &nbsp;“扶正祛邪”、“砒霜”治疗、提高患者生活质量的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 晚期肿瘤治疗的领域比较乱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 有些西药的成分来自于中药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 西医也会有中医治疗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 社会的道德问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 认知不足导致偏见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 针刺（针灸）的原理是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> “筋膜”理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 直接刺激</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a> 《解剖列车》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 经络的本质是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 针刺的发源？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3700">1:01:40</a> 提高认知，不同疗法殊途同归~</span></p>]]></description>
